     "body": "<p>In testing/learning some JSON-LD for CLAW I used the data from <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2390\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2390</a> and performed GETs with <tt>Accept: application/ld+json; profile=</tt> using compacted, expanded and flattened.</p>\n\n<p>I am using 4.7.1</p>\n\n<p>The results are here <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/whikloj/914aaff77758c5817fbe0b031a5e2c78\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://gist.github.com/whikloj/914aaff77758c5817fbe0b031a5e2c78</a></p>\n\n<p>In a discussion with <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a50883b8c6006bf90212\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a50883b8c6006bf90212\" data-account-id=\"6089a50883b8c6006bf90212\" accountid=\"6089a50883b8c6006bf90212\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Diego Pino Navarro</a> he mentioned that the flattened did not appear correct.</p>\n\n<p>As I said I'm new to this, but I figured I should bring it to your attention for confirmation or education.</p>",
